  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uKZEWLR.png\" alt=\"套件橫幅\" width=\"700\" height=\"450\" /></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/J9jY4Z6\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YeQZceJ.png\" alt=\"Discord 徽章\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Dr_prof_Luigi\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/24auqwO.png\" alt=\"Patreon 徽章\" width=\"234\" height=\"76\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-end-of-minecraft\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Om4BpzM.png\" alt=\"TEOM 徽章\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-parts-pack\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d51JHWL.png\" alt=\"本套件採用高品質 UNU 零件\" width=\"700\" height=\"120\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br /><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lCmsctToQt0\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本模組需要以下前置模組：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Minecraft 運輸模擬器</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-parts-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">UNU 零件包</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-railroading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Immersive Railroading（選配）*</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>下載我的其他套件！</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><br /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">UNU 民用系列 - 來自 UNU 的高品質民用车、卡車、飛機與火車！</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-air-cooled-vehicles-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MTS 氣冷引擎包 - 福斯、Corvair 及其他氣冷引擎車輛！</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-unuverse-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">擴展 UNUverse 包 - 來自 BlackThorne 之外 UNU 宇宙的載具！</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iconic-movie-vehicles-pack-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">經典電影載具 - 2015 年經典之作<br /><br /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fallout-mc\"><strong>試試看官方伺服器！</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /><br />所有載具均提供 BlackThorne 藍配色，以及沙漠、森林與冬季迷彩。<br /><br />載具列表：<br />UNU Wolf [NR-490-LTG]<br />UNU Mule [ZF-174-MCG] - 多種配置<br /><br />若安裝 Immersive Railroading*，您還將獲得一把巨型火車砲**。<br /><br />更多載具即將推出！<br /><br />*若將副檔名從 .jar 改為 .zip，即可作為 IR 資源包使用，無需 MTS<br /><br />**火車砲目前尚無法運作，但說真的，任何看到它的人都絕對會感到不寒而慄。</p>",
